iban.pizza
==========

This project is a fork and substantial rewrite of the "goiban" family of
projects originally written by Chris Grieger:

    https://github.com/apilayer/goiban
    https://github.com/apilayer/goiban-service
    https://github.com/apilayer/goiban-data-loader

Those three repositories are MIT licensed, Copyright (c) 2013-2018 Chris
Grieger. Their licence text is reproduced in LICENSE and continues to apply to
the portions of this project derived from them (notably the mod-97 validation
routine and the country/length tables in iban/).

NOT DERIVED FROM: github.com/apilayer/goiban-data
    That repository carries no licence file and no licence headers, so no
    permission to use it has been granted. No code from it has been copied.
    The bankdata/ package here was written from scratch.

