DATA SOURCES
    Bank reference data is obtained from national and European sources, each
    under its own terms of use. See docs/data-sources.md for the per-source
    licence position. Notably the OeNB dataset carries an explicit copyright
    and liability reservation in its file header, and redistribution terms
    differ per source. GLEIF BIC-to-LEI data is published under CC0.
